# Ambient barks for the six Enhanced villagers (T-125): 15 each, one short line (12 words at most) in a speech bubble.

addto npc.marcus.bark
0 ~ => marcus.bark.1 cat=bark :: Measure twice.
0 ~ => marcus.bark.2 cat=bark :: A straight board is a happy board.
0 ~ => marcus.bark.3 cat=bark :: The hall roof is nearly fixed.
0 ~ => marcus.bark.4 cat=bark tag=funny :: Juno labeled my chisel "Sharp (Rude)". She isn't wrong.
0 ~ => marcus.bark.5 cat=bark :: Mind the sawdust. It gets into everything.
1 weather:rain => marcus.bark.rain.1 cat=bark :: Rain tests every roof. Mine passes.
1 weather:storm => marcus.bark.storm.1 cat=bark :: Checking the doors twice. A third time, quietly.
1 weather:wind => marcus.bark.wind.1 cat=bark :: Wind finds every loose nail. I keep a list.
0 season:spring => marcus.bark.spring.1 cat=bark :: Spring means sheds. Everybody wants one in April.
0 season:winter => marcus.bark.winter.1 cat=bark :: Winter is for furniture. Warm hands, long grain.
0 hour<10 => marcus.bark.morning.1 cat=bark :: First cut of the day is the cleanest.
0 map:Carpenter => marcus.bark.here.1 cat=bark :: The chair by the stove is Dorian's.
0 weekday:wed => marcus.bark.wed.1 cat=bark :: Wednesday. Bench with Bram. Not a word.
0 ~ => marcus.bark.rare.1 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=funny :: I built a door that wouldn't close. Now it's a window.
0 ~ => marcus.bark.rare.2 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: My father's pencil is half its size. I still use it.

addto npc.odalys.bark
0 ~ => odalys.bark.1 cat=bark :: Sit. Doctor's orders.
0 ~ => odalys.bark.2 cat=bark :: Sleep is the best medicine and the cheapest.
0 ~ => odalys.bark.3 cat=bark :: Wash your hands. I'll say it once more.
0 ~ => odalys.bark.4 cat=bark tag=funny :: Everyone says they feel fine. Fine is not a symptom.
0 ~ => odalys.bark.5 cat=bark :: One bowl of soup. One hour of sunshine. Repeat.
1 weather:rain => odalys.bark.rain.1 cat=bark :: Wet feet cause colds. Keep yours dry.
1 weather:storm => odalys.bark.storm.1 cat=bark :: Storm. Stay in. Warm milk, if nervous.
1 weather:snow => odalys.bark.snow.1 cat=bark :: Gloves on. Frostbite begins as pride.
0 season:summer => odalys.bark.summer.1 cat=bark :: Drink water. Wear a hat. This is not a suggestion.
0 season:fall => odalys.bark.fall.1 cat=bark :: Wool, hot baths and silence. Doctor's orders.
0 hour<10 => odalys.bark.morning.1 cat=bark :: First patient is usually the kettle.
0 map:Clinic => odalys.bark.here.1 cat=bark :: The wobbly chair is yours. It's diagnostic.
0 weekday:sat => odalys.bark.sat.1 cat=bark :: Saturday. Clinic shut. I'm a layperson with opinions.
0 ~ => odalys.bark.rare.1 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=funny :: I prescribed laughter once. He filed a complaint.
0 ~ => odalys.bark.rare.2 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: I keep a drawer of thank-you notes. I just open it.

addto npc.felix.bark
0 ~ => felix.bark.1 cat=bark :: Mornin'.
0 ~ => felix.bark.2 cat=bark :: Patience is the whole trick. And bait.
0 ~ => felix.bark.3 cat=bark :: You should've seen the other one.
0 ~ => felix.bark.4 cat=bark tag=funny :: Caught one this big. Bigger, now that I think.
0 ~ => felix.bark.5 cat=bark :: The tide waits for no one.
1 weather:rain => felix.bark.rain.1 cat=bark :: Rain's best. The fish forget to be careful.
1 weather:storm => felix.bark.storm.1 cat=bark :: Storm. I tie the boat twice and talk it down.
1 weather:snow => felix.bark.snow.1 cat=bark :: Snow on the pier. The gulls look offended.
0 season:summer => felix.bark.summer.1 cat=bark :: Long evenings, slow lines. Lovely.
0 season:fall => felix.bark.fall.1 cat=bark :: Fall runs. You can hear the fish thinking.
0 hour<10 => felix.bark.morning.1 cat=bark :: Dawn's the best hour. Water's still deciding.
0 map:Beach => felix.bark.here.1 cat=bark :: Mind the nets. They're plotting.
0 weekday:thu => felix.bark.thu.1 cat=bark :: Thursday. Stall's shut. I'm on the pond.
0 ~ => felix.bark.rare.1 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=funny :: Pulled up a boot with a clock in it. Clock was right.
0 ~ => felix.bark.rare.2 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: First fish I caught, I let go. It's still looking.

addto npc.dorian.bark
0 ~ => dorian.bark.1 cat=bark :: Quiet. You'll scare the mushrooms.
0 ~ => dorian.bark.2 cat=bark :: Not me. The forest.
0 ~ => dorian.bark.3 cat=bark :: Look under old roots. Everyone looks up.
0 ~ => dorian.bark.4 cat=bark tag=funny :: Found a mushroom shaped like a hat. Very smug.
0 ~ => dorian.bark.5 cat=bark :: I'd rather talk to a tree.
1 weather:rain => dorian.bark.rain.1 cat=bark :: Rain brings the mushrooms. Good day.
1 weather:storm => dorian.bark.storm.1 cat=bark :: Storm. The forest bows. I wait under oak.
1 weather:snow => dorian.bark.snow.1 cat=bark :: Snow. Every branch, a line in white.
0 season:fall => dorian.bark.fall.1 cat=bark :: Fall. Best mushrooms. Truffles hide well.
0 season:spring => dorian.bark.spring.1 cat=bark :: Wild garlic first. Then everything.
0 hour<10 => dorian.bark.morning.1 cat=bark :: Dew on every web. I try not to break them.
0 map:Forest => dorian.bark.here.1 cat=bark :: Step softly. The moss is listening.
0 weekday:sat => dorian.bark.sat.1 cat=bark :: Market. Noise. I leave a mushroom and go.
0 ~ => dorian.bark.rare.1 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=funny :: I argued with a stump. I lost.
0 ~ => dorian.bark.rare.2 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: First mushroom I found is dried in my pocket.

addto npc.elara.bark
0 ~ => elara.bark.1 cat=bark :: Keep your socks on!
0 ~ => elara.bark.2 cat=bark :: The best medicine is a good laugh. And rest.
0 ~ => elara.bark.3 cat=bark :: I knit when it's slow. Don't tell Dr. Penn.
0 ~ => elara.bark.4 cat=bark tag=funny :: Tiny hat on the plant. Dr. Penn took it off.
0 ~ => elara.bark.5 cat=bark :: Tea's on. Stay a minute?
1 weather:rain => elara.bark.rain.1 cat=bark :: Rain means sniffles. I'll be busy!
1 weather:storm => elara.bark.storm.1 cat=bark :: Thunder's the sky clearing its throat.
1 weather:snow => elara.bark.snow.1 cat=bark :: Snow! Everyone's cheeks are pink. Free health check.
0 season:summer => elara.bark.summer.1 cat=bark :: Sand in the plasters. Sea air in the soul.
0 season:winter => elara.bark.winter.1 cat=bark :: This scarf is the length of a cat.
0 hour<10 => elara.bark.morning.1 cat=bark :: First patient's the kettle. It's been waiting.
0 map:Clinic => elara.bark.here.1 cat=bark :: Not that chair. The skeleton's shy.
0 weekday:sat => elara.bark.sat.1 cat=bark :: Saturday. Beach, sandwich, scarf. Bliss.
0 ~ => elara.bark.rare.1 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=funny :: I knitted a sock for a chair. It wore it proudly.
0 ~ => elara.bark.rare.2 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: The first person I bandaged hugged me. I'm still chasing that.

addto npc.ione.bark
0 ~ => ione.bark.1 cat=bark :: I set something aside for you.
0 ~ => ione.bark.2 cat=bark :: A good book is a quiet door.
0 ~ => ione.bark.3 cat=bark :: Overdue is a state of mind.
0 ~ => ione.bark.4 cat=bark tag=funny :: The returns box is sticky. It's decided to stay that way.
0 ~ => ione.bark.5 cat=bark :: Everything here is older than it looks.
1 weather:rain => ione.bark.rain.1 cat=bark :: Rain on the windows. The best reading weather.
1 weather:storm => ione.bark.storm.1 cat=bark :: Thunder. I read aloud. The books have heard worse.
1 weather:snow => ione.bark.snow.1 cat=bark :: Snow. Even the clock is tiptoeing.
0 season:fall => ione.bark.fall.1 cat=bark :: Fall. Everyone wants a long book and a short day.
0 season:winter => ione.bark.winter.1 cat=bark :: First snow's my favorite day. The books wait politely.
0 hour<10 => ione.bark.morning.1 cat=bark :: The library smells of paper and possibility.
0 map:Library => ione.bark.here.1 cat=bark :: Take your time. Even the chairs are old.
0 weekday:sat => ione.bark.sat.1 cat=bark :: Saturday. I'm in the forest. A book without a spine.
0 ~ => ione.bark.rare.1 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=funny :: A bee returned a book. It left politely.
0 ~ => ione.bark.rare.2 cat=bark rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: The first book I shelved here, I still check on.
